            "review_title": "Review at Marugame Udon Vincom Phạm Ngọc Thạch",
            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n0\nDelicious, Fresh and Reasonably Priced\nMay 2020\nNormally, I'm not a huge fan of restaurants in shopping centers since they somehow feel less \"authentic\" to me. However, today, I needed a break from the Hanoi summer heat which has suddenly become part of our everyday reality. We decided to try Marukame Udon thanks to the great photo-menu. We had the beef rice bowl and the chicken teriyaki with egg. Both were really excellent. Don't forget to add chives, cilantro/corriander, ginger, etc. \n\nThe staff too was very friendly and seemed intrigued by the foreigners who had found their way into the restaurant. Take a seat by the window and overlook the whole city!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 8, 2020",
